  "remarks": "GBi.011 Designation: a) Major General b) Deputy Chief of Staff of the Armed Forces. Passport no: DA0002186, issued on 30 Mar. 2007, issued in Guinea-Bissau (Expiration date 26 Aug. 2013). Other information: Ture was listed on 18 May 2012 pursuant to paragraph 4 of resolution 2048 (2012) as “Member of the “Military Command” which has assumed responsibility for the coup d’état of 12 April 2012.”; Listing: Listed by 2048 Committee on 18 May 2012",
